<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00817">
	<title>Drive shafts and boots</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>scheduled maintenance items
					<indexterm>drive shafts and boots</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<p>Check the drive shafts, boots, and clamps for cracks, deterioration, or damage. Replace any damaged parts and, if necessary, repack the grease.</p>
	</conbody>
